Z||000000||Haze_Performance||09-18-2000||06:35 PM||||So here's what I'm doin!!<P>I print out Forum info on light sticker paper. (The same size as the org. cards) Then if I see a Fiero at ANY dealer I slap one in the drivers side visor. So when its opened BAM there it is. Ive done 4 so far. 2 of the dealers were closed when I did it (Sunday) but the other 2..... I asked the salesman and they said "Sounds great, It might help us sell them if someone knows where he/she can still get part's"<P>So if you buy a Fiero in Illinois and it had a sticker on the visor "It's been Hazed" lol  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P><BR><P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/mycarsig.jpg">       <B>1985 Sport Coupe - Coming Soon 1987 SE</B><P><BR><B>Website's  <A HREF="http://www.WS6Fiero.com" TARGET=_blank>www.WS6Fiero.com</A> &                  <A HREF="http://www.hazeperformance.com" TARGET=_blank>www.HazePerformance.com </A></B>||||reg||14
